WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.500
- Let's close up this hour
with something sweet I found

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.360
on the interwebs that
you'll want to know about.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.899
This is #What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.899 --> 00:00:09.070
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.160
All right, so we look to
our men and women in blue

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.340
to step up in times of trouble,

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.650
maybe after an accident or a crime,

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.150
but a Texas police department
stepped up in a big way

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.710
when they simply came
across a woman in need.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.030
Dialing in to share their story,

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.436
let's say hi to Officers Dustin
Kincaid and Sarah Wallace

00:00:25.436 --> 00:00:26.419
(audience cheering)

00:00:26.419 --> 00:00:27.840
of the Seguin Police Department.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.205
They watch on Fox 29
KABB San Antonio at 4:00.

00:00:32.205 --> 00:00:33.538
So hi, officers.

00:00:35.444 --> 00:00:37.023
- Hi.

00:00:37.023 --> 00:00:37.960
- Hi, Kelly.
- So Officer Kincaid,

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.793
I'll start with you.

00:00:38.793 --> 00:00:40.270
So how did this story begin?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.340
- Well, I was dispatched to a medical call

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.943
for an 87-year-old woman.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.510
Once I made contact with her,

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.710
I found that she did not need

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.850
any kind of medical assistance,

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.350
but through my conversations with her,

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.410
I found that she was going through

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:57.103
a really difficult time financially.

00:00:58.092 --> 00:00:59.800
Her refrigerator had
just recently went out.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.440
She had either enough money
to buy a new refrigerator

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.433
or enough food for the month.

00:01:05.535 --> 00:01:06.368
And with talking to her,

00:01:06.368 --> 00:01:09.320
she was someone that really
helped out in the community

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.270
when she was able to,

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.690
and it really reminded me of my mom

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.600
when she was on hospice

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.310
and how the community
came together with us

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.870
to help us through that trying time

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.530
with me losing my mom.

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:25.330
So I told her that I was gonna help her.

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.140
I did not know how,

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:29.660
but I was 100% dedicated
to figuring it out,

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:31.230
something to help her.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.650
- Oh my gosh, you have such a great heart.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.440
Well, Officer Wallace,
(audience applauding)

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.280
Officer Kincaid told you
about the encounter, right?

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.113
- Yes, ma'am.

00:01:39.113 --> 00:01:41.340
So he had briefed me on the situation,

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.450
and when I found out,

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.850
I sent an email out to
our police department.

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.980
Within about 15 minutes or so,

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.290
we had officers, dispatchers,
civilian employees

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.940
all coming in and donating money

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:55.060
towards the cause of trying to
get her a used refrigerator,

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.850
so that way she could store her food.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.870
And it was awesome
because when I reached out

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:03.070
and started researching
on Facebook Market,

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:05.040
we let the seller know what was going on

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.710
and she graciously
donated the refrigerator

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.030
that we were looking at.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:09.863
So we were able
(audience applauding)

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:10.696
to take all
- Wow.

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.700
- Of the money that we
raised for this woman

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.810
and use it towards groceries

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:16.420
and pantry items and everything.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.510
And then when our community found out,

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.140
they also participated as well.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.960
So it was incredible to see
not only our department,

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.260
but our community come together

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.760
to help a citizen in need.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:29.690
- Absolutely, get it Texas.
(audience applauding)

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.010
I love it.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:33.880
Well, thank y'all so much,
Officer Kincaid and Wallace,

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.760
for not only your service,

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.660
but also joining us today
and taking the time.

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:38.830
We really appreciate it.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.838
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:40.838 --> 00:02:42.260
- [Sarah] (laughs) Thank you.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.093
- [Dustin] Thank you.

00:02:43.093 --> 00:02:43.950
- All right,

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.350
and girl also you have
some beautiful blue eyes.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.280
I can't let that go.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.600
They are startling.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.140
And that's not all,

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.500
we're inspired by your
department's act of kindness

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.420
and so is our season-long
partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.300
the go-to pen of "The
Kelly Clarkson Show."

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.540
So they'll be using their G2 gel ink pen

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.530
to write the woman you helped out

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.040
a check for $1,000

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.270
to help her out.
(audience cheering)

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:07.120
- Wow, thank you so much.
- Yeah, so look at that.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.690
Look at that moment you took

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.940
and you made something really
beautiful happen for her.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.130
That's so amazing, thank y'all so much.

